    "catch 10 starred fruits to fill your basket. the small star attached to a fruit marks a good fruit; it is not a bonus star. fruit counts only after it enters and settles in the basket. each good catch earns +10 points. missing good fruit or letting bad fruit pass costs no points.": {
      "comment": "Preserved original numbered game-help source; foreign-language review pending.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "catch 10 starred fruits to fill your basket. the small star attached to a fruit marks a good fruit; it is not a bonus star. fruit counts only after it enters and settles in the basket. each good catch earns +10 points. missing good fruit or letting bad fruit pass costs no points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a standalone star banks one star pass and does not fill the basket or add points. catching bad fruit spends exactly one available pass and play continues. without a pass, that catch attempt ends; you can retry. passes carry between catch attempts in this learning session, not into a new session.": {
      "comment": "Preserved original numbered game-help source; foreign-language review pending.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
