            "value": "a standalone star banks one star pass and does not fill the basket or add points. catching bad fruit spends exactly one available pass and play continues. without a pass, that catch attempt ends; you can retry. passes carry between catch attempts in this learning session, not into a new session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
